                <li><strong>Law students:</strong> exam preparation, thesis research, and exploring legal concepts with an AI assistant that searches the complete Belgian legislation.</li>
                <li><strong>In-house counsel and compliance officers:</strong> quickly find specific regulations and consult legislative history.</li>
                <li><strong>Notaries, property professionals and civil servants:</strong> rapid access to current legal texts and relevant judgments.</li>
                <li><strong>Interested citizens:</strong> for a deeper understanding of which laws apply to a specific situation.</li>
