        </div>
    </details>

    <details>
        <summary>How much does WetWijzer Pro cost?</summary>
        <div>
            <p>&euro;2.99 per month, VAT included. The subscription renews monthly and can be cancelled at any time. No annual contract or notice period.</p>
            <p>For comparison: commercial legal databases such as Jura or Strada lex typically cost hundreds of euros per month.</p>
        </div>
    </details>

    <details>
        <summary>Can I try Pro before subscribing?</summary>
