                <li><strong>General questions:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@wetwijzer.be">info@wetwijzer.be</a></li>
                <li><strong>Privacy requests and removal of personal data from case law:</strong> <a href="mailto:privacy@wetwijzer.be">privacy@wetwijzer.be</a></li>
